  "paragraph": 8,
  "text": "Before we dive deep, zoom out for one moment. This exact harness architecture does not only power coding tools. Swap the tools and verifiers, and the same engine drives browser and computer-use agents like ChatGPT Agent with CUA, Claude Computer Use, Browser Use, and Manus, clicking buttons and inspecting screenshots. It drives deep research agents searching, fetching, and checking citations, and it drives operations and support agents triaging logs while gating refunds or production changes behind human review. We will use coding agents as our concrete laboratory because compilers and unit tests give unambiguous truth, and every pattern transfers directly.",
